{"html":"<div><h2 id=\"basic-introduction-of-lightburn\"> Basic Introduction of LightBurn</h2>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><span><strong>LightBurn is layout, editing, and control software for your laser cutter.</strong></span></p>\n  <p>LightBurn is a native application written for Windows and Mac OS. No subscription needed.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<figure><img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/software/联想截图_20251013152140.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\">\n  <figcaption>Cr.https://lightburnsoftware.com/</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 id=\"download-and-install-lightburn\"> Download and Install LightBurn</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"https://lightburnsoftware.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download Link</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 id=\"how-to-connect-the-device-to-lightburn\"> How to Connect the &nbsp;Device to Lightburn</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li>Connect XT&amp;XRF to LightBurn via&nbsp;Ethernet</li>\n  <li>Connect XT&amp;XRF to LightBurn via&nbsp;WiFi</li>\n  <li>Connect XT&amp;XRF to LightBurn via USB Cable</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 id=\"lightburn-user-manual\"> LightBurn User Manual</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"https://docs.lightburnsoftware.com/latest/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Docs</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://lightburnsoftware.com/pages/tutorials\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tutorials</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://forum.lightburnsoftware.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Support Forum</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>","toc":[{"id":"basic-introduction-of-lightburn","level":2,"text":"Basic Introduction of LightBurn"},{"id":"download-and-install-lightburn","level":2,"text":"Download and Install LightBurn"},{"id":"how-to-connect-the-device-to-lightburn","level":2,"text":"How to Connect the Device to Lightburn"},{"id":"lightburn-user-manual","level":2,"text":"LightBurn User Manual"}]}